# oxfmt reads this file by default. README.md carries a centered HTML banner
# block (<p align="center"><img ...></p>, a ~189-char line); oxfmt 0.63.0's
# markdown formatter is NONDETERMINISTIC on it — byte-identical README passed
# `fmt:ci` on one CI run (d17d682) and failed the next (0c01685), same oxfmt
# 0.63.0, same linux runner. Exclude the prose banner file from format-checking
# until oxfmt's markdown support stabilizes; it is documentation, not code.
README.md

# Generated OKF §8 indexes (record spec §1): `ksor build` writes them byte-exact and
# `pnpm check` refuses any drift, so a formatter must never touch them.
packages/ksor/templates/scaffold/knowledge/**/index.md
workbench/example-corpus/knowledge/**/index.md

